// Syncthing ignore list for the shared `axis` folder.
//
// Everything here is either regenerable on the machine that needs it, or media
// far too large to be worth a phone's storage. Patterns without a leading slash
// match at any depth; a leading slash anchors to this folder's root.
//
// The (?d) prefix marks a pattern as deletable, so Syncthing may clean these up
// rather than refusing to remove a directory that contains them.

// --- big media and render artifacts -------------------------------------
// ghost exports its renders next to the project. ghost_4k.avi alone is 4.8G.
(?d)*.avi
(?d)*.mp4
(?d)*.mkv
(?d)*.mov

// The Mask Lab's working clips: Godot-transcoded .ogv plus extracted audio,
// ~3.2G. Regenerated by re-importing the source. Drop the three lines below if
// you ever want to actually run the mask editor from the phone.
(?d)*.ogv
(?d)*.webm
(?d)*.wav

// yt-dlp's download cache for the YouTube import feature (~425M).
(?d)/ghost/masks/_downloads

// The ghost feedback loop's per-iteration console dumps.
(?d)/ghost/feedback

// --- Godot ---------------------------------------------------------------
// Import cache, shader cache, editor layout, export credentials. Regenerated
// on first open; ~331M in ghost alone.
(?d).godot
(?d).import

// --- Gradle / Android / Kotlin -------------------------------------------
(?d).gradle
(?d)build
(?d).kotlin
(?d).cxx
(?d)captures
// Machine-specific SDK path - syncing it would point the phone at a path that
// does not exist there.
(?d)local.properties
// ...except the one we hand-publish for installing on the phone. A negation
// only counts if it comes before the pattern it overrides.
!/nutube/nutube.apk
(?d)*.apk
(?d)*.aab
(?d)*.jks
(?d)*.keystore

// --- Python --------------------------------------------------------------
(?d)__pycache__
(?d)*.pyc
(?d).venv
(?d)venv
(?d).pytest_cache
(?d).ruff_cache
(?d).mypy_cache

// --- Node ----------------------------------------------------------------
(?d)node_modules
(?d).parcel-cache

// --- editors and OS junk -------------------------------------------------
(?d).idea
(?d)*.iml
(?d).vscode
(?d).DS_Store
(?d)Thumbs.db
